      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl1.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unbelievable...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She knows exactly what she’s doing here. She knows what I’m going to think, but it’s like she doesn’t even care.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...she probably doesn’t. This is Nodoka we’re talking about. I’m pretty sure feelings are a thing she doesn’t actually...you know, have.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How did I get here? I was with Touka just a second ago.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl2.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I assume your legs had something to do with it. I’ve found they’re typically the device that brings me from one place to the other. But that’s probably just because I can’t drive yet.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve...been with Touka a lot tonight...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And...I...uhh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess...I don’t have anything to...add to that...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just...thought it was...a little strange...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, we’ve all kind of noticed that. Just no one has really said or done anything about it because pretty much all of us love her and think she’s way out of your league.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All of you are out of my league but that won’t stop me from having sex with you one day.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl3.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Knock it off! This is hardly the time to joke around like that!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...uhh...I...uhh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s no need to respond, Sana. Like Futaba said, that was just a joke. And I don’t intend to have sex with any of you because I’m a good guy and good guys don’t have sex with high school girls.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you doing?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean, “What are you doing?”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean what happened to your filter?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I gave it to Yumi as a birthday present. I figure it will help her from saying anything else that leads to her getting sexually assaulted in locker rooms going forward.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl4.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I said knock it off!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Futaba yells at me. But Futaba never yells at me, so this is probably just a dream. Which means that I should do my rounds again and have sex with everybody before I wake up so no one feels left out.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, who’s first?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "fuck futobo",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "your lucky number is 46782",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ luckynumberyay = 46782",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "do sex ron",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "your lucky number is 99635",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ luckynumberyay = 99635",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "rape santa",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "your lucky number is 392354",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ luckynumberyay = 392354",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, it’s one thing for you to happily dismiss everything Nodoka is doing because you don’t care, but would you maybe consider thinking about those of us that do?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel sick to my stomach that she’d stoop this low all for the sake of...collecting information. And if you’re just going to be mean about it-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene happy3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/happy3.png",
      "alt": "happy3"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl5.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know what’s happening.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...fine.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But still, you shouldn’t say things like...that thing you said a minute ago. If one of us took it the wrong way, you could get into a lot of trouble.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...I think Sensei...means it when...he says he’s sorry...and...um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I won’t...I won’t...tell anyone if...um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S...Sorry...it’s just...uhh...it’s...hot in...this costume and...uhh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t...I can’t...really...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I get it now.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl6.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Get what? I don’t think the “joke” was very hard to understand.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I mean I get why he’s been with Touka all night. I’m just...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think I can really say any more than that without making him feel worse.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop talking about me like I’m not here. If you have something to say to me, you can say it to my face.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. I’ll talk all about it while you’re walking me home. Go say goodbye to everyone.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl7.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Home? You’re leaving already?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I might as well. Otoha’s not here, you’re mad at me, and I want to talk to Sensei for a little while. There’s not really any reason for me to stick around.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t think it’s...really necessary to...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I don’t want to go home. I want to party.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl8.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I get that. You love Halloween and costumes and blah, blah, blah.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...Sensei, I really think you might be better off somewhere else right now. This isn’t the...environment you want to be in when things get bad.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bad how? There’s nothing bad about being a party animal.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S...Sensei is right! He should...stay here and...um...we should...keep...uhh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He...he should just...stay here...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanaisabadgirl9",
