    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanaisabadgirl9.webp",
      "alt": "sanaisabadgirl9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, you’re not helping. Leave this to the person here with the most experience in mental breakdowns.",
