    {
      "en": ": S...See? He’s fine. He just needs some rest...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": New question — are you doing okay, Sana? Because you’re acting a little strange right now too and I’m starting to think the lack of air in your costume might be messing with your head.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...uhh...actually...come to...think of it, it’s...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
