    {
      "en": ": Woah, what’s going on? What happened? Is Sana okay? I told her she was going to die in that costume.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This...is it...this is...the end...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will not let another girl die.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We need to take her somewhere cool. Do you have, like...a room we can get her and Sensei some water in? Preferably somewhere we won’t get lost along the way to inside your labyrinth of a house?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s an infirmary down the hall and Geoffrey is a licensed general practitioner. Let me call him and-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll...be fine with...a little rest...I just...have to lie down and...and change clothes...",
