    {
      "en": ": A...Anyway, the infirmary is the thirteenth door on the left-hand side of the fifth corridor. Just hug the right wall until you see a suit of armor with a cracked helmet and-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
